WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:04.370
NEPAL IS IN MOURNING FOLLOWING
SUNDAY'S PLANE CRASH NEAR THE

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:08.341
CITY OF POKHARA.
DOZENS OF PEOPLE ON BOARD A

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.543
YETI AIRLINES FLIGHT WERE
KILLED WHEN IT PLUNGED TO THE

00:00:10.543 --> 00:00:13.479
GROUND.
JUST HOURS AGO, THESE WERE THE

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:19.352
SCENES AT A NEARBY HOSPITAL AS
FAMILY MEMBERS WAITED FOR THEIR

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.454
LOVED ONES BODIES TO BE
IDENTIFIED AND RELEASED.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:26.493
SEARCH OPERATIONS AT THE CRASH
SITE HAVE ENDED FOR THE NIGHT.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:30.396
THEY WILL RESUME ON TUESDAY AND
INVESTIGATORS HOPE TO LEARN

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.333
MORE SOON FROM THE PLANE'S TWO
FLIGHT RECORDERS WHICH HAVE NOW

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.436
BEEN RECOVERED.
CNN'S VEDIKA SUD SHOWS US

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.570
SOME OF THE FLIGHT'S FINAL
MOMENTS.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:43.476
&gt;&gt; A VIDEO ON SOCIAL MEDIA
APPEARS TO SHOW THE PASSENGER

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:47.447
PLANE BANKING SUDDENLY, MOMENTS
BEFORE THE CRASH IN WESTERN

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:50.383
NEPAL.
ON SUNDAY MORNING, A YETI

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:53.419
AIRLINES OPERATED FLIGHT
EMBARKED ON A ROUGHLY 30-MINUTE

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:58.258
FLIGHT FROM THE CAPITAL OF
KATHMANDU TO POKHARA, THE

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:00.760
COUNTRY'S SECOND MOST POPULATED
CITY.

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:04.030
&gt;&gt; TRANSLATOR: WE HEARD A LOUD,
THUNDEROUS CRASH AND REACHED

00:01:04.030 --> 00:01:05.665
OUR --
--

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:08.268
TO SEE WHAT HAPPENED.
WE SAW A LOT OF SMOKE AND

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:10.336
REALIZE THERE WAS A CRASH.
WE RUSHED TO THE SITE.

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:14.307
&gt;&gt; THE FLIGHT WAS LAST IN
CONTACT WITH THE POKHARA 18

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:18.244
MINUTES AFTER TAKEOFF BEFORE IT
CAME CRASHING DOWN IN THE

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.613
NEARBY GORGE.
IT IS THE DEADLIEST AIRCRAFT IN

00:01:20.613 --> 00:01:23.683
MORE THAN THREE DECADES IN
NEPAL.

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:27.387
DOZENS OF BODIES HAVE BEEN
PULLED OUT OF THE GORGE USING

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:29.055
CRANES.
SOME HAVE YET TO BE IDENTIFIED

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:32.825
BY FAMILY MEMBERS.
ON MONDAY, RESCUE TEAMS

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.762
RETRIEVED THE BLACK BOXES.
THE FLIGHT DATA AND COCKPIT

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.831
VOICE RECORDER COULD HELP
UNDERSTAND THE MOMENTS LEADING

00:01:38.831 --> 00:01:41.934
UP TO THE CRASH.
THE HIMALAYAN COUNTRY HAS A

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:45.705
RECORD OF AIR ACCIDENTS DUE TO
ITS MOUNTAINOUS TOPOGRAPHY AND

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:49.609
SUDDEN CHANGES TO THE WEATHER,
BUT IN THIS CASE, OFFICIALS SAY

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:52.745
IT WAS A CLEAR DAY.
THE NEPAL GOVERNMENT HAS SET UP

00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:55.782
A PANEL TO PROBE THE AIR
ACCIDENT AND WILL HOPEFULLY

00:01:55.782 --> 00:01:59.619
FIND ANSWERS TO WHAT LED TO THE
THIRD WORST AVIATION ACCIDENT

00:01:59.619 --> 00:02:06.659
IN NEPAL'S HISTORY.
&gt;&gt; LET'S GET YOU TO THE

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:09.696
DEVELOPMENTS FROM NEW DELHI IN
NEIGHBORING INDIA.

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:13.566
HOW QUICKLY DO AUTHORITIES
BELIEVE THEY WILL BE ABLE TO

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.568
REVEAL ANY FURTHER DETAILS ON
WHAT HAPPENED AND WHY?

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:22.375
&gt;&gt; WELL, THAT THE, ACCORDING TO
THE NEPAL GOVERNMENT, IT'S

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:26.546
GOING TO TAKE ABOUT 45 DAYS FOR
ALL THE INVESTIGATION TEAM TO

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:30.617
ACTUALLY GO AHEAD AND SUBMIT
THEIR --

00:02:30.617 --> 00:02:36.256
IT HAS BEEN CONSTITUTED.
IT IS A HUGE SIGNIFICANT

00:02:36.256 --> 00:02:40.193
DEVELOPMENT THAT THE BLACK
BOXES, AS YOU MENTION, HAVE

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:42.462
BEEN RETRIEVED FROM THE CRASH
SITE.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:45.198
THAT HOLDS THE KEY TO THE
INVESTIGATIONS, BECKY.

00:02:45.198 --> 00:02:49.102
WE WILL GET TO KNOW ABOUT THE
LAST MOMENTS FROM THE BLACK

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.204
BOXES.
OFFICIALS HAVE TOLD CNN THAT

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:55.074
THEY ARE IN GOOD CONDITION.
THAT COULD ANSWER THE QUESTIONS,

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:57.310
NOT ONLY HELD BY THE
INVESTIGATORS, BUT ALSO THE

00:02:57.310 --> 00:03:00.313
FAMILY MEMBERS.
THEY WILL BE LINING UP OUTSIDE

00:03:00.313 --> 00:03:04.317
THE HOSPITALS WAITING TO
RECEIVE THE BODY OF THEIR LOVED

00:03:04.317 --> 00:03:06.252
ONES.
AS FOR THE LATEST FROM THE

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.322
CRASH SITE, TODAY WAS DAY TWO
OF THE SEARCH OPERATIONS.

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:14.394
IT HAS ENDED WITH ONE BODY IN
ADDITION TO THE 68 RECOVERED ON

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:19.132
SUNDAY.
CRANES WERE USED TO PULL THESE

00:03:19.132 --> 00:03:24.270
BODIES OUT FROM THE GORGE.
WE KNOW THAT ALL OF THESE

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.438
BODIES, A POSTMORTEM WILL BE
CONDUCTED.

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:31.611
THERE WERE 15 FOREIGN NATIONALS
ON BOARD THE FADED FLIGHT.

00:03:31.611 --> 00:03:34.414
WE HAVE BEEN TOLD THE BODIES
WILL BE AIRLIFTED TO A HOSPITAL

00:03:34.414 --> 00:03:37.583
AND KATHMANDU WHERE THE
POSTMORTEMS WILL BE CONDUCTED.

00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:41.454
THEY WILL BE HANDED OVER TO
FAMILY MEMBERS, BUT ONLY 38

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:43.523
BODIES HAVE BEEN IDENTIFIED AS
WE SPEAK.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:47.360
THERE ARE A LOT MORE BODIES
WHICH NEED TO BE IDENTIFIED AT

00:03:47.360 --> 00:03:49.362
THIS POINT.
HEARTBROKEN SCENES OUTSIDE THE

00:03:49.362 --> 00:03:52.431
HOSPITAL --
FAMILIES ASKING WHAT REALLY

00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:55.535
HAPPENED, TELL US MORE, BUT WE
HAVE TO WAIT FOR THOSE ANSWERS

00:03:55.535 --> 00:04:00.373
FROM THE TEAM, THE PROBE TEAM
THAT IS INVESTIGATING THIS AIR

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:02.809
CRASH.
IT IS THE DEADLIEST IN MORE

00:04:02.809 --> 00:04:06.813
THAN THREE DECADES.
&gt;&gt; VEDIKA SUD ON THE STORY,

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:09.282
THANK YOU.

